        <detaileddescription>
<para>Merge two values if possible.</para><para>The <computeroutput>rightValue</computeroutput> is merged into the <computeroutput>leftValue</computeroutput> if possible, or this method returns false without changing either value. After a successful merge, the <computeroutput>rightValue</computeroutput> will be removed from the <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1IntervalMap" kindref="compound">IntervalMap</ref> and its destructor called. </para>        </detaileddescription>
