        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Discard the right part of a value.</para><para>This method is the same as <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1MergePolicy_1a4b376cf2c6e2daa73822cf44c3eb7e32" kindref="member">split</ref> except the right part of the resulting value is discarded. This is sometimes more efficient than calling <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1MergePolicy_1a4b376cf2c6e2daa73822cf44c3eb7e32" kindref="member">split</ref> and then destroying the return value. </para>        </detaileddescription>
