    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Policy indicating how values are merged and split.</para><para>Adjacent nodes of an <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1IntervalMap" kindref="compound">IntervalMap</ref> can be joined together provided their values can also be joined together. This joining is a key feature of an <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1IntervalMap" kindref="compound">IntervalMap</ref> since it can significantly reduce the number nodes required in the underlying map. </para>    </detaileddescription>
